WEBVTT

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.320
Fire!

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.200
Luvia-san, was that good enough?

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:21.910
Yes. It's just a quick operations 
check, so that's plenty.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.900
So, what's that for?

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.340
On the off-chance we need it, you could say.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:28.880
Hmm...

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.830
Shoot.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.340
Good work, Miyu.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:35.680
I went ahead and broke the bedrock 
where it looked hardest.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:36.970
Thanks.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.470
Sorry that I couldn't help out over there.

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:41.140
No, it's all right.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.280
I know it's late, but I have a question.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.520
Hmm? What is it?

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:46.820
No matter how much construction we do here,

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:49.020
won't we still be "jumping" into the dirt?

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.310
Oh, now that you mention it...

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:52.990
Don't worry about that.

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:56.890
The Mirror World is a state of 
many possibilities overlapping.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.030
When we jump, we're able to

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:02.040
select the relative state from 
the overlapping states.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:05.540
Try to think of it like Schrödinger's cat.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:10.290
I-I don't really get it, but if we'll 
be okay, that's all that matters.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.260
Hmm, I see.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:17.300
So the eighth Card lies ahead?

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:25.170
Hey! Aren't you wasting activation gems?

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:27.770
My, you truly have a pauper's spirit.

00:01:27.770 --> 00:01:29.300
What?

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:32.230
Besides, the gems I'm using are my own.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:36.380
I just can't stand seeing wasted money 
disappear right before my eyes!

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:37.480
Oh?

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.950
<i>They haven't changed...</i>

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:38.950
Stop it!

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.410
Well? How's progress?

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:46.210
Well, we have about a third left.

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:48.540
Thanks for helping us out!

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:54.420
Well, I actually felt a bit guilty for just 
having fun all summer break up to now.

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:56.210
What are you saying?

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:58.030
As kids, your job is to have fun.

00:01:58.030 --> 00:01:59.350
Oh, right.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.750
Speaking of having fun...

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:02.930
Here's your reward for helping us out this time.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:06.420
Wow!

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.150
A theme park!

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:44.280
Let me ride it! Let me ride it! 
I'll make you cry like a baby!

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:53.990
<b>Fearsome Animal Land</b>

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.530
I knew being on guard from the 
start was the right choice.

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:50.170
I want one of those...

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:52.230
That ring around Son Goku's head.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.920
Wow, it's really pretty.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:58.280
<b>Episode 4 
Theme Park Panic</b>

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.460
It was just built recently.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:00.950
Yeah, it looks pretty good.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:01.930
It does.

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:04.680
Also, they have lots of cute mascots!

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.180
Lots...

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:10.310
It's called "Animal Land," 
but there are only lions?

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:13.030
Lion-kun is the mascot of the park.

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:16.560
I guess they figured he was so cute 
that just one species was enough.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:18.560
I heard he was a peeping tom.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.030
Scary!

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.490
This is a strange place.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:27.300
Um, Miyu-chan, is this your first 
time coming to a theme park?

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:31.950
Yeah. There weren't any where I used to live.

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.220
Really?

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:35.840
In that case, all the more 
reason to have fun today.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.630
Attention, please!

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:42.760
Now that we're at the theme park, 
let me outline the rules!

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:45.320
One, don't do anything dangerous.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.790
Two, don't get separated.

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.510
Three, if something is troubling you, speak up.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:52.150
Understand? Promise Mama, okay?

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:53.180
Okay!

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:56.990
Hey, Illya, is it okay if Mama's 
the only one in charge?

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:58.660
We couldn't help it.

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.200
Onii-chan's busy with his club,

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.320
and Sella and the rest had other things to do.

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:05.880
Illya-chan's mom is so pretty!

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:08.490
I wonder if she'd switch places with my mom.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.390
Even just for a day.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:13.130
You're very pretty, madam.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:14.540
Your skin's smooth, and you smell nice.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.460
You're perfect, but...

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:19.240
If you got into a fight, my mom would win!

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:20.790
Why are you making them fight?!

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:23.670
You're all such good, honest children.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.630
Ugh, now I'm getting worried.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:30.770
All right! Let's play until the park closes!

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:32.540
Yeah!

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:33.730
Yeah!

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:38.650
All right, this one is definitely first up!

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:41.190
A roller coaster!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.790
Huh? Actually, are you okay to ride these?

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:47.600
What do you mean by "okay"?

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.870
<b>Exit                 Entrance</b>

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:51.870
Oh, I'm sorry, young lady. 
Could you come over here?

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:53.960
What? A fan of mine?

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:56.330
You want a picture? Way to go, me!

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:58.980
Hmm, you barely pass.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:00.890
You don't need to make peace signs.

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:03.630
Don't be shy. I'm in a good mood today.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.340
That's right, there's a height 
restriction, isn't there?

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:14.130
I-I-I-It's h-h-h-here!

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:14.130
What's going on with her?

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.270
She's louder than usual.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:19.760
Well, in a way, this moment is the 
best part of a roller coaster.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:23.570
That's right, Miyu, it's your first time 
experiencing this clanking, huh?

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:25.210
I don't understand it.

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:28.490
Initially climbing like this is a natural 
way to turn potential energy

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.150
into kinetic energy, but—

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.020
Miyu's making sounds I've never heard from her!

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:42.420
Let's go there next!

00:06:57.260 --> 00:06:59.140
Hey, sit yourself down!

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:15.740
Whew, I'm beat. Let's take a break.

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.100
How is it, Miyu? Having fun?

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:18.910
Yeah.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:23.330
I was especially impressed by that coaster, 
and the motion of that free-fall ride.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.970
When you factor in safety,

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:27.210
building it would be harder than average.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:31.720
I don't really get it, but you seem 
to like thrill rides a lot.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.240
Speaking of having fun...

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:37.680
Theme parks are so fun!

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.070
You aren't too bad yourself, madam!

00:07:40.070 --> 00:07:42.810
Your driving technique with 
that go-kart was crazy!

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:46.930
The adult in charge is having 
more fun than we are.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.530
She gets along with everyone, too.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:53.120
Well, Kiritsugu and I married for love,

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:55.960
but we couldn't hold a ceremony 
for various reasons...

00:07:55.960 --> 00:07:57.790
I smell drama!

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:01.540
Now she's even leaking our family history...

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:07.810
<i>Roar! We're about to start the 
parade of 108 Lion-kuns.</i>

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.810
It's a parade!

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:10.740
<i>Everyone come and watch, roar!</i>

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:11.420
I did hear that it's one of 
this park's centerpieces.

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.090
Let's go check it out!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:17.850
But be careful, or you'll get lost in the 
parade and we'll never find you again.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:22.020
You're exaggerating, Mama. 
That would never...

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.020
Roar, roar!

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:37.570
Roar! Roar! Roar! Roar!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.030
I found Illya!

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.570
Jeez, there are too many.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:40.680
It's great that the costumes are cute, but...

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:43.580
There's also a huge crowd, 
and they're packed so densely.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:46.460
I guess this is really popular...

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:48.710
What happened to Tatsuko?

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:52.850
Oh, she went and barged 
into the parade by herself.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:55.130
We thought she was a goner,

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:59.260
but this weirdly intimidating
Lion-kun rescued her.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:04.350
It looked more like it was disposing 
of trash in its way, though.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.770
Comparing her to trash is mean, Suzuka-chan.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:09.440
W-Well, I'm glad she's safe.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:12.280
Where's Mama?

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.940
Huh? You're right! She's gone!

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.240
Uh-oh, we got separated?

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.790
There's no way to look for her in this crowd.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:19.700
What do we do?

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:23.000
If I recall, there's a lost child center over there.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.670
I don't know if they'd put out a call for her,

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:29.000
but Mama might go there looking for us, too.

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.790
Right. For now...

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:35.590
I thought I heard familiar voices.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.550
Caren-sensei?!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:39.890
I've told you before, haven't I?

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.540
The sound of healthy children hurts my ears.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.900
Why are you here, Sensei?

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.850
Is it a part-time job?

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.050
Of course not.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.480
Teachers are prohibited from part-time jobs.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:52.690
So why?

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.440
For me, this is an oasis,

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:59.660
where I can see crying children 
who've lost their way up-close.

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:02.160
She really is twisted!

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.800
I forgot...

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:07.290
On our way here, Mama gave me a cell phone.

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:10.750
Why didn't she give it to me? Hmph!

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.750
Hello? Oh, Mama?

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.240
I'm sorry.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:14.440
I got swept away, and ended up in some hall

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:16.640
for wedding ceremonies or something.

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:20.010
Then they said I was guest #10,000...

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:20.510
Huh?

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:22.870
So they forced me to change,

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.350
and they said they'd take pictures for souvenirs.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:27.670
Pictures in a wedding dress?

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:29.100
What the heck?

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:32.780
Right? Maybe it's not too late...

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:35.110
No, we're all right, Mama-san!

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:37.830
Please go ahead and let them take pictures!

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:36.920
Hey, what's the idea?

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.440
Don't stop at one. Take lots!

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:42.020
Yeah, she said they never had a ceremony.

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:42.990
It's perfect.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:47.110
Madam, what are you wearing right now?

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:50.910
Please be sure to send the 
photos to Illya-chan's father.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.250
Also, to me...

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:56.830
But aren't there attractions you 
can't enjoy without a guardian?

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:59.010
Oh, uh, that's...

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:02.560
Yes! We happened to run into one 
of our teachers from school!

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.060
So I think we'll manage!

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:04.690
Huh?

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.720
There you have it! So don't worry about us!

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.490
Oh, they hung up...

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:14.480
Well, I guess if a teacher from school 
is with them, I can rest easy.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:16.530
Hey, Suzuka, why did you do that?

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.620
Well, I was just going with the flow...

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:22.120
Yeah, we want Mama-san to enjoy herself, too.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:24.700
We've done such a good job here!

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:28.090
Besides, I bet she'll look really pretty.

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:30.210
And there are many ways I can use that...

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:34.250
No, Mama getting her picture taken is fine, but...

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:36.400
Yeah! The problem's on our end!

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:37.890
I know what you want to say!

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:40.920
But we can't go back now! And so...

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:43.700
Please!

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.310
What?

00:11:45.310 --> 00:11:50.350
Um... Could you please be 
our guardian for a while?

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:54.360
Sure.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.490
Huh?

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:58.270
All right!

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.900
What led to this?

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:04.620
It's a good turn of events, isn't it?

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:06.820
Mama-san gets to have fun, and so do we.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:09.790
I can't help but feel she has an ulterior motive.

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:12.630
Ah!

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:15.460
Lion-kun...

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:29.430
Th-Th-Thank you...

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:31.000
That one was...

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.310
The one who rescued Tatsuko-chan!

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.400
Or the one who threw her out for being a pain!

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:37.770
Thank you very much.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.770
I happened to end up being their guardian.

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:44.860
You should join us, too.

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:47.970
This wild beast says she'll accompany us.

00:12:47.970 --> 00:12:50.330
Huh? Really? That's possible?

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.650
Glad to have you!

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:55.640
If we get to reserve our own Lion-kun
along with you, we have it made!

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:57.710
Thank you very much for earlier!

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:03.750
Onward, beast!

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:05.760
Oh, well.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.820
Roar, roar!

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:43.590
Well, we've been having fun,

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.060
but I feel parts of me are really worn out...

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:52.260
Well, seeing lions everywhere 
is starting to get me curious.

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.730
I feel like I'll see them in my dreams.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:58.090
Who cares how many there are, 
when they're cute?

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:00.020
Are you sure you're not being brainwashed?!

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:02.280
That's right. It's fine.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:03.190
You too, Mimi?

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:05.650
Sorry for the wait!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.250
Welcome back, Illya.

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:10.410
I'm back. You wanted the lemon tea, right?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.620
Here you go.

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:12.660
Yeah, thank—

00:14:13.560 --> 00:14:14.420
Illya!

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:15.900
Hmm? What's wrong?

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:17.390
Your bracelet...

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:20.130
No way! The charm is gone!

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.950
Huh? You lost it?

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:25.050
I'm not sure... Um...

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.320
It's the one you got at the beach, right?

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.760
How long has it been gone?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.230
I-I don't know...

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:31.740
It's the work of a demon!

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:33.510
Tatsuko-chan, get a clue!

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:36.260
Let's search all the places we've been.

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:37.980
All right, I guess I'll go with you.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:40.320
Okay, let's split up and search!

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:40.940
Yeah!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.130
Leave it to me!

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:44.450
Don't worry, I'm sure we'll find it.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:46.190
Everyone... Thank you!

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:49.820
Good grief, so restless.

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:54.000
What do I do?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.000
And it was a gift from Onii-chan...

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:56.890
Illya-san?

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:58.500
Ruby? What is it?

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:02.130
Uh, I thought I'd at least report this to you.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.250
You see, Sapphire-chan...

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.850
Mama, look!

00:15:05.850 --> 00:15:06.880
What?

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.980
My, that's amazing!

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:11.340
Just as you'd expect from a new park!

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:15.000
Sapphire, please.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.720
All right. Then...

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:22.670
Search failed.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:26.310
The scan range is far too broad, Miyu-sama.

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:27.310
Even so...

00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:28.160
Miyu?

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:28.780
Illya...

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:30.460
What are you doing?

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:33.380
I thought I'd have Sapphire help us look.

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:36.910
But I'm sorry. We still haven't found it.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.970
Okay, but you didn't need to trance.

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:41.370
If someone saw you...

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:45.070
Don't worry. I'll just look like an attraction.

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.960
Y-You think so?

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.340
I'll try once more.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.490
Then let's do it together.

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:52.270
Ruby, you can do it, too, right?

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:53.300
Of course!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:55.250
Illya...

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:04.720
How did it... go...

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:07.110
You can tell by their expressions.

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:09.270
I'm sorry. We didn't...

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:14.250
<i>Roar! Thank you all for coming today, everyone.</i>

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:16.310
<i>It's almost closing time!</i>

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:17.620
It's already this late?

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:19.070
<i>At night, their wild nature explodes.</i>

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.810
Do you think we could explain this to them?

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:23.820
<i>You'll be eaten if you stay, 
so take care going home. Roar!</i>

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:22.480
They'd probably just tell us they'd
look for it, and send us home.

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:25.120
Leave this to me! You all go on ahead!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.340
What good would it do to leave it to you, idiot?

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:30.240
Shut up! You don't know until you try, right?!

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:33.300
That's enough, everyone.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:40.540
If it's closing time, it can't be helped.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.550
It's all right. Onii-chan will—

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:43.180
No!

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:46.460
You can't give up.

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:49.600
That's... That's a precious...

00:16:50.120 --> 00:16:51.150
I'll go search again!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:52.150
Ah, Miyu!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.980
Humans are powerless pigs.

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:57.630
Children, especially so.

00:16:58.430 --> 00:17:03.280
But that's why there are some things 
these puny beings can do.

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:07.170
Observe, analyze, and act.

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:08.760
Just do that.

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:12.130
That's right... Acting without a plan will just...

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:13.550
Miyu...

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:18.350
Listen, I'm happy you're willing 
to search, but we— Huh?

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:22.260
Looking at this latch,

00:17:22.260 --> 00:17:25.730
it probably wasn't broken, but just unfastened.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.350
But it's designed so that it won't unfasten easily.

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:31.720
Yeah, you're right.

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:33.770
Then it didn't just fall off.

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:37.950
Something must have happened that 
unfastened it by some special force.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:42.850
Something that could apply a 
special friction, or torque, or...

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:47.920
The parade!

00:17:49.890 --> 00:17:50.880
Sapphire...

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.030
Yes. If the area is limited, then...

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:01.600
Miyu!

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:06.390
Found it.

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:11.440
It probably came loose when 
we got jostled, and... Illya—

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.820
I was really upset over losing it!

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.780
Thank you, Miyu!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:24.860
No.

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:27.390
I felt the same.

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:29.670
I...

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.400
consider this our bond.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:36.590
The one we share with everyone who was there.

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:39.680
So I don't want to lose it.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.600
And I don't want you to lose yours.

00:18:47.370 --> 00:18:49.810
Hey, Illya! Miyu!

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:53.010
You both run fast, so cut us some slack!

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:55.490
It's the work of a demon!

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.190
Enough of that.

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.450
Let's go, Miyu.

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:10.190
I'm sorry!

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:10.890
Oh, Mama!

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:12.000
You're finally here!

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:16.450
They had me change into dozens 
of different dresses...

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:17.900
I'm really sorry!

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:19.880
No, no... Don't worry about it.

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:24.080
If you got good pictures, just be 
sure to send them to Papa-san.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.470
And to me, too...

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:27.520
Thank you.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.940
That reminds me, where's the 
teacher who looked after you?

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:32.200
Over there.

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:43.240
Illya-chan, what did you buy 
at the souvenir stand?

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.280
Well...

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:46.950
Thank you for taking care of the children.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:50.360
Yes, they were quite a handful.

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:52.000
It was rather troublesome.

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:56.840
If it was that much of a bother, 
you could have easily refused.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.260
So why did you...

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:00.380
Coincidence and circumstance.

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:03.640
You can feel free to share, 
if there were any other reasons.

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:05.140
There weren't.

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:12.620
Since it seems my role is over, I'll be leaving.

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:13.650
Okay.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:15.730
And I bought this, too.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:16.490
Oh, well.

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:18.010
Isn't it cute?

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.860
Don't you already have one?

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:23.120
It's slightly different from the version I have!

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:27.000
I also bought a lion mask for my mother, roar!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:29.330
Well, shall we all head home?

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:32.950
Did you all have fun at the theme park today?

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:34.040
Yes!

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:15.520
How long do you intend to wear that?

00:22:17.300 --> 00:22:18.800
What are you planning?

00:22:19.950 --> 00:22:23.860
An Enforcer was playing with children, 
in an outfit like that.

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:27.740
It would be a waste if I hadn't managed 
to take a few commemorative photos.

00:22:28.140 --> 00:22:29.830
You're the one who made me do it.

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:32.390
If you have other sources of income, that's fine.

00:22:32.720 --> 00:22:37.190
But I wouldn't pay even one coin
of my donations... offerings?

00:22:38.780 --> 00:22:40.920
Anyway, why were those kids there?

00:22:41.230 --> 00:22:45.170
The same reasons. Coincidence and 
circumstance. That's all.

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:47.580
Your part-time job's over now, right?

00:22:47.580 --> 00:22:49.640
As an extra service, I'll take you to the city.

00:22:50.490 --> 00:22:52.510
Are you allowed to wear that home?

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:56.980
When I explained the situation to my 
boss, he said I could take it home.

00:22:57.530 --> 00:22:59.350
What do you plan to do with it?

00:23:01.290 --> 00:23:02.610
Can't you tell?

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:06.440
I can use it as a sleeping bag!

00:23:10.110 --> 00:23:10.860
I see.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.390 --> 00:23:25.170
You can't calculate how much fun 
you'll have at a festival!

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:26.210
This time...

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:30.470
I'm not sure I can do it very well.

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:32.850
...come in pairs, without vulnerability!

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:35.920
With this, I'm Magical Bushido Musashi!

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:35.960
<b>Yukatas and Fireworks</b>
